WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.235
-Here's what people
are talking about.

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.403
Some news out of Washington.

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:05.371
President Trump announced
that he's releasing

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:06.672
thousands of files on JFK

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.808
even though they were
already set to be released.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.743
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:12.011
And he said,
"Not only that,

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:14.347
I'm declaring October 31st
Halloween."

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:18.717
[ Laughter and applause ]
"I'm doing it. That's right.

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:21.254
We'll all be saying
'Merry Halloween' again.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.821
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.821 --> 00:00:24.957
This is kind of crazy.
There was a conspiracy theory.

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:27.226
Did you see this
going around that Melania --

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:29.495
Melania Trump had been replaced
with a body double?

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:31.264
Did you hear this?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:32.531
It's a rumor, but some people

00:00:32.531 --> 00:00:34.300
are pointing
to these photos as proof.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.268
Take a look.
So, the woman on the left

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:37.837
they say is fake Melania,

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.206
and the woman on the right
is real Melania.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:43.209
But it didn't help
that Donald Trump was saying --

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.278
Well, he said this
while standing with her. Watch.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.879
-We will be doing that.

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:50.116
My wife, Melania,
who happens to be right here.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.051
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:53.419
-Why would you say that?

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:55.555
-Why'd he need to say that?
-Why would anyone ever --

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:59.558
"She happens to really be really
here, so it's not a hologram.

00:00:59.558 --> 00:01:01.727
It's a real person, so...

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:03.329
It's a human being.
There's no way --

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:04.564
Now I'm gonna walk through her.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:05.899
I'm gonna walk --
-Zwwwm!

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:08.167
-Maybe -- Do I have a twin?
I don't know."

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:09.502
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.404
"It's like David Copperfield

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.672
walking through
the Great Wall of 'Gyna.'"

00:01:13.672 --> 00:01:15.474
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:15.474 --> 00:01:21.380
"She may be real.
She may not be real.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:23.783
Well, the story
turned out to be false,

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:26.119
but there are other theories
about people in the White House

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.353
that are
still being talked about.

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:28.454
For instance --
These are rumors.

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:29.788
-Rumors.

00:01:29.788 --> 00:01:31.657 line:0%
-There's a rumor that
Attorney General Jeff Sessions

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:33.326 line:0%
is actually a gnome
from the Rose Garden

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.194 line:0%
that comes to life
during the daytime.

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:37.096 line:0%
-Really?
-These are rumors.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.297
-That's a rumor.

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:39.798
That's not true.
That's just a rumor.

00:01:39.798 --> 00:01:42.168 line:0%
-There's a rumor
that Senator Mitch McConnell

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.803 line:0%
was replaced by a sad faucet.

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:45.204 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
-Really?

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:47.640
-How could I prove it?
-I'll disprove it.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.542
It's just a rumor.
-It's a rumor.

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.644
-It's just hearsay.
-Yeah.

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.346
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:56.582 line:0%
Finally, it is rumored
that President Trump's tie

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:58.050 line:0%
is actually just
a Fruit By The Foot.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.919 line:0%
-Really?
-He eats it --

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:01.153
He can eat his tie.

00:02:01.153 --> 00:02:04.791
-It gets longer?
-"An edible tie.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:08.461
Happy hallo-istmas."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:09.929
-Gosh.

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:11.898
But this story really blew up,
so we actually got in touch --

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:14.200
"The Tonight Show" -- we got in
touch with the real Melania,

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.934
and she agreed
to talk to us tonight,

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:17.403
right now,
to clear things up.

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:19.272
Melania, are you there?

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:22.007 line:0%
-Hi, Jimmy.
Yes.

00:02:22.007 --> 00:02:23.376 line:0%
Hi, yes.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:26.612 line:0%
I am very happy to be here.

00:02:26.612 --> 00:02:28.280 line:0%
-Yeah.
-Yes.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.983
-Yeah.
Well, I've never met you before.

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:31.818
I have to say,
you seem a little different.

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:35.555
-Huh? Me?
No I'm just old me.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:38.224
Me, Melan--
"Me," short for "Melania."

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.392
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:42.127
-"Me" is short --
"Me" is short for "Melania."

00:02:42.127 --> 00:02:43.862
Yeah, I know that.
-Yeah.

00:02:43.862 --> 00:02:47.500
-Me -- are you Melania,
or are you a body double?

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.402
-I'm a -- I'm a Melania.

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:51.170
-Okay.

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:53.206
Okay, well, look, just to
make our audience comfortable

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:55.207
and prove
that you're not a body double,

00:02:55.207 --> 00:02:56.275
I'm going
to ask you some questions

00:02:56.275 --> 00:02:58.010
that only
the real Melania would know.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:59.045
Are you okay with that?

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:01.514
-Uh, yeah, sure.
Yeah, definitely.

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:03.983
I want to answer your questions,
and I can.

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:07.419
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.419 --> 00:03:09.021
-That doesn't count
as a question.

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:11.024
You're already getting nervous.
-Okay.

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:12.258
-Now, our first question --

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:13.993
-First of three?

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:15.227
-I don't know how many.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:16.562
-How many questions?
-I don't know the first --

00:03:16.562 --> 00:03:17.830
-How many questi--
Okay.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:18.931
-All right. Let's just start
with the first one.

00:03:18.931 --> 00:03:20.366
-Okay, fine.
-"First of three."

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:21.634
I don't know.

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:25.304
What is the name of the city
where you were born?

00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:27.239
-Slo-- Slov-- Uh, Slov--

00:03:27.239 --> 00:03:28.607
-Yeah. Slovakia.
-What did you say?

00:03:28.607 --> 00:03:29.942
Did you say Slovakia?

00:03:29.942 --> 00:03:32.444
-Yes, I said Slovakia,
but that's the country.

00:03:32.444 --> 00:03:34.147
-That was the answer.

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:36.549
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:38.217
-There's no way of --
But --

00:03:38.217 --> 00:03:40.552
-Did you say that?
-Did I --

00:03:40.552 --> 00:03:42.254
-Yeah, I did say that,
but I asked you the question.

00:03:42.254 --> 00:03:43.990
-Oh, you were wrong?

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:46.025
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:48.595
-No, no, I --
I wasn't wrong, but...

00:03:48.595 --> 00:03:49.895
Let's just go
to the next question.

00:03:49.895 --> 00:03:53.166
-Okay.
Okay, redo, redo, redo.

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:54.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:56.436
-Melania,
where in the White House

00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:57.703
is the First Lady's office?

00:03:57.703 --> 00:03:59.872
-It's in the attic.

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:00.940
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.975
-Okay. Now, this is --
I don't know.

00:04:02.975 --> 00:04:05.477
Is there an --
-There's an attic above the --

00:04:05.477 --> 00:04:07.246
There's how many floors?

00:04:07.246 --> 00:04:09.348
-Uh...
Three? I have no --

00:04:09.348 --> 00:04:10.516
-Yeah, three.

00:04:10.516 --> 00:04:13.352
I was gonna say three,
and three plus an attic.

00:04:13.352 --> 00:04:14.854
That's where
they keep the woman --

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:17.590
That's me.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.324
-The First Lady.

00:04:19.324 --> 00:04:22.762
Last question -- as First Lady,

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:25.398
what have you said
are your three main goals?

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:27.966
-There's three?
-Yeah. Yeah, yeah, three.

00:04:27.966 --> 00:04:29.268
Just three main goals.

00:04:29.268 --> 00:04:30.536
-Three main goals.

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:32.705
-They have to be the main goals,
not the side goals.

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:33.773
[ Laughter ]
-No.

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:35.207
Just give me
three of the main ones.

00:04:35.207 --> 00:04:36.575
-Oh, yeah,
three of the main ones.

00:04:36.575 --> 00:04:37.577
Sure, sure, I thought --

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:40.245
Okay. I was ju--
I thought, "Who...?"

00:04:40.245 --> 00:04:42.581
Uh, b-bullying.

00:04:42.581 --> 00:04:44.249
S-Stop it.

00:04:44.249 --> 00:04:47.086
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, yeah, thank you, Melania.

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:49.155
-Sugar.
Keep eating it.

00:04:49.155 --> 00:04:50.622
[ Laughter ]
And, uh...

00:04:50.622 --> 00:04:52.125
-Your goal
is to keep eating sugar?

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:56.295
-You know,
and m-make sure you remember...

00:04:56.295 --> 00:04:57.463
-Yes.
-...friendship is real.

00:04:57.463 --> 00:04:58.764
-Okay.
Thank you very much.

00:04:58.764 --> 00:05:01.801
Melania --
the real Melania Trump.

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:03.169
Friendship is real.
Oh, yeah, there you go.

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:04.237
Your glasses.

00:05:04.237 --> 00:05:05.538
Doesn't even know
how to put on glasses.

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:06.572
Okay. Very good.

00:05:06.572 --> 00:05:08.574
Silly.
Oh, my gosh. Thank you.

00:05:08.574 --> 00:05:10.142
[ Applause ]

00:05:10.142 --> 00:05:12.211
What?
-What?

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:13.579
-Did you guys see this?

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:18.117
I saw that CNN released a new ad
