00:06:27.587 --> 00:06:30.022
He just doesn't --
The guy can't age.

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:32.024
He looks fantastic.

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:34.126
That's right.
John Stamos is getting married.

00:06:34.126 --> 00:06:36.695
