wedding deejay -- D.J. Tanner.

00:06:36.695 --> 00:06:39.898
-Oh.
-Oh, hey, hey!

00:06:39.898 --> 00:06:41.967
Hey-oh!
Hey!

00:06:41.967 --> 00:06:44.604
-Guys, I saw that
"Boo 2! A Madea Halloween"

00:06:44.604 --> 00:06:47.473
